(415, 1, '2025-03-20 04:27:57', '2025-03-20 04:27:57', '<h6>\n					Welcome to Glozin\n				</h6>\n				<h2>\n					Best Store<br />\nAvailable to Everyone!				</h2>\n					Over 15 years of experience, we have meticulously curated collections that transcend fleeting trends,<br />\nembodying a timeless elegance that resonates with our discerning clientele.				\n															<img width=\"1800\" height=\"750\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about-us-banner.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about-us-banner.webp 1800w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about-us-banner-300x125.webp 300w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about-us-banner-768x320.webp 768w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about-us-banner-1024x427.webp 1024w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about-us-banner-1536x640.webp 1536w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about-us-banner-600x250.jpg 600w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about-us-banner-130x54.webp 130w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about-us-banner-780x325.jpg 780w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1800px) 100vw, 1800px\" />															\n								0\n									k\n				<h5>\n					Products for Sale				</h5>\n					That\'s why we strive to offer a diverse range of products that cater to all styles.				\n								0\n									k\n				<h5>\n					Happy Customer				</h5>\n					We pride ourselves on creating great products and experiences with our valued customers.				\n								0\n									k\n				<h5>\n					Partner Brand				</h5>\n					Partner with brands that share our values, striving to protect our environment.				\n				<h6>\n					Why Choose Us				</h6>\n				<h2>\n					Our Peculiar Things				</h2>\n					Our fashion products are characterized by innovative and on—trend designs. We pride ourselves in pushing the<br />\nboundaries of conventional fashion, delivering new, bold and captivating styles.				\n												<img width=\"760\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_1.webp\" alt=\"\" fetchpriority=\"high\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_1.webp 760w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_1-228x300.webp 228w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_1-600x789.jpg 600w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_1-130x171.webp 130w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" />										\n									<h3>					Cultural Standards					</h3>													\n						We are committed to setting high ethical standards in production and ensuring mindful manufacturing through audits, training and education.					\n												<img width=\"760\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_2.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_2.webp 760w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_2-228x300.webp 228w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_2-600x789.jpg 600w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_2-130x171.webp 130w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" />										\n									<h3>					Designed to Last					</h3>													\n						From traditional tailoring to the most informal pieces. Our Glozin collections feature the latest trends with the maximum comfort.					\n												<img width=\"760\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_3.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_3.webp 760w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_3-228x300.webp 228w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_3-600x789.jpg 600w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_3-130x171.webp 130w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" />										\n									<h3>					Freedom for Everyone					</h3>													\n						The designs have been created adopting the current trends, while leaving room for personal expression among young people.					\n			<meta itemprop=\"worstRating\" content=\"0\">\n			<meta itemprop=\"bestRating\" content=\"5\">\n					<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M15.9566 6.05028C16.0087 6.21336 16.0139 6.38188 15.9722 6.55583C15.9305 6.72978 15.8419 6.87656 15.7065 6.99615L12.2206 10.1925L13.2523 14.9219C13.2835 15.0958 13.2679 15.2643 13.2054 15.4274C13.1533 15.5905 13.0595 15.7264 12.924 15.8351C12.7781 15.9438 12.6218 15.9982 12.4551 15.