 5.73499 15.9045 5.87633 15.9566 6.05028Z\" fill=\"#F3FC81\"></path></svg>				\n					<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M15.9566 6.05028C16.0087 6.21336 16.0139 6.38188 15.9722 6.55583C15.9305 6.72978 15.8419 6.87656 15.7065 6.99615L12.2206 10.1925L13.2523 14.9219C13.2835 15.0958 13.2679 15.2643 13.2054 15.4274C13.1533 15.5905 13.0595 15.7264 12.924 15.8351C12.7781 15.9438 12.6218 15.9982 12.4551 15.9982C12.2883 16.0091 12.132 15.971 11.9861 15.884L8 13.3889L4.0139 15.884C3.95137 15.9166 3.87842 15.9438 3.79505 15.9656C3.7221 15.9873 3.64915 15.9982 3.57621 15.9982C3.49284 15.9982 3.40426 15.9819 3.31046 15.9493C3.2271 15.9275 3.14894 15.8895 3.07599 15.8351C2.94051 15.7264 2.84151 15.5905 2.77898 15.4274C2.72688 15.2643 2.71646 15.0958 2.74772 14.9219L3.77942 10.1925L0.29353 6.99615C0.158055 6.87656 0.0694746 6.72978 0.0277898 6.55583C-0.0138949 6.38188 -0.00868433 6.21336 0.0434216 6.05028C0.0955276 5.87633 0.184108 5.73499 0.309162 5.62627C0.444637 5.51755 0.595745 5.45232 0.762484 5.43058L5.38949 5.00657L7.21841 0.538165C7.28094 0.375085 7.38515 0.244621 7.53105 0.146772C7.67694 0.0489241 7.83326 0 8 0C8.16674 0 8.32306 0.0489241 8.46895 0.146772C8.61485 0.244621 8.71906 0.375085 8.78159 0.538165L10.6105 5.00657L15.2375 5.43058C15.4043 5.45232 15.5502 5.51755 15.6752 5.62627C15.8107 5.73499 15.9045 5.87633 15.9566 6.05028Z\" fill=\"#F3FC81\"></path></svg>				\n					\" Glozin will become an example of the responsible business model by doing business with<br /> kindness, profit and bringing practical and long—term values to customers, employees,<br /> partners, the community for the environment and for shareholders. \"\n				<h5>\n					Carie—Gosée Hera				</h5>\n					CEO and Founder Glozin Store				\n															<img width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_4.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_4.webp 1200w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_4-300x200.webp 300w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_4-768x512.webp 768w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_4-1024x683.webp 1024w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_4-600x400.jpg 600w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_4-130x87.webp 130w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_4-780x520.jpg 780w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" />															\n				<h6>\n					Our Factories				</h6>\n				<h2>\n					The Best Product				</h2>\n					We spend a lot of time finding the best factories around the world—the same\nfactories that make your favorite designer brands. We visit them regularly and\nbuild strong personal relationships with the owners. Each factory is audited for\ncompliance to assess factors such as fair wages.				\n							<a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Link for Learn More\">\n			Learn More		</a>\n				<h6>\n					Our Products				</h6>\n				<h2>\n					Timeless Products				</h2>\n					At Glozin, we’re not big on trends. We want you to wear our pieces for years,\neven decades, to come. That’s why we source the finest materials and factories\nfor our timeless products— like our Grade-A cashmere sweaters, Italian shoes,\nand Peruvian Pima tees.				\n							<a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Link for Learn More\">\n			Learn More		</a>\n															<img width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_5.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_5.webp 1200w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_5-300x200.webp 300w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_5-768x512.webp 768w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_5-1024x683.webp 1024w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_5-600x400.jpg 600w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_5-130x87.webp 130w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_5-780x520.jpg 780w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" />															\n				<h6>\n					How We Work				</h6>\n				<h2>\n					Expanding Horizons				</h2>\n					At Glozin, our work culture is deeply rooted in collaboration, innovation and passion. We believe that a positive and<br />\ninclusive work environment is the foundation for creativity and success.				\n												<img width=\"760\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_6.webp 760w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_6-300x197.webp 300w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_6-600x395.jpg 600w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_6-130x86.webp 130w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" />										\n									<h3>					The Core of Us					</h3>													\n						At our core lies a passion for innovation, creativity, and collaboration. We’re driven to push boundaries and create meaningful solutions that inspire growth					\n												<img width=\"760\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_7.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_7.webp 760w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_7-300x197.webp 300w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_7-600x395.jpg 600w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_7-130x86.webp 130w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" />										\n									<h3>					Our Products					</h3>													\n						Crafted with precision and creativity, our products blend innovation and functionality to deliver exceptional experiences.					\n												<img width=\"760\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_8.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_8.webp 760w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_8-300x197.webp 300w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_8-600x395.jpg 600w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/about_banner_8-130x86.webp 130w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" />										\n									<h3>					Our Careers					</h3>													\n						We believe in nurturing talent, fostering growth, and embracing creativity. Join our team to expand your horizons, collaborate on meaningful projects', 'About Us', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'about-us', '', '', '2025-03-20 04:27:57', '2025-03-20 04:27:57', '', 0, 'http://localhost/glozin/?page_id=415', 0, 'page', '', 0),
