(2508, 1, '2025-04-25 04:16:19', '2025-04-25 04:16:19', '', 'banner_sale', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'banner_sale', '', '', '2026-10-04 15:59:43', '2026-10-04 15:59:43', '', 1632, 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/banner_sale.webp', 0, 'attachment', 'image/webp', 0),
(2828, 1, '2025-04-28 02:56:18', '2025-04-28 02:56:18', '<div class=\"overflow-hidden collapsible-content\">\n<div class=\"collapsible-content_inner mb-12 rich__text-mt-0 product_description\">\n\nCherry extract 500 mg, celery seed extract 250 mg, and turmeric extract 100 mg per tablet. Adults take one tablet daily. Consult a healthcare professional if pregnant or nursing. Keep out of reach of children. Store in a cool, dry place.\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong>Features Product:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Hyaluronic acid, chamomile extract, and aloe vera.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Benefits:</strong> Deeply cleanses, hydrates, and replenishes moisture.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Texture:</strong> Soft, creamy foam that provides a refreshing, non-drying cleanse.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Suitable for all skin types, especially for those needing hydration and gentle cleansing.</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>How to Use:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Dispense a small amount of foam onto wet hands.</li>\n 	<li>Gently massage onto damp face in circular motions to cleanse.</li>\n 	<li>Rinse thoroughly with warm water and pat dry with a towel.</li>\n 	<li>For best results, use morning and night as part of your skincare routine.</li>\n</ul>\nExperience deeply hydrated, soft, and fresh skin with Blue Hyaluronic Cleansing Foam, the perfect daily cleanser for your skincare routine.', 'Gout Relief Tablets', 'Natural joint support formula with cherry, celery seed, and turmeric extracts. Adults take one tablet daily for wellness.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'gout-relief-tablets', '', '', '2026-10-04 15:59:43', '2026-10-04 15:59:43', '', 0, 'https://wpglozin.com/medicine/shop/blue-hyaluronic-cleansing-foam/', 0, 'product', '', 1),
(2831, 1, '2025-04-28 02:56:27', '2025-04-28 02:56:27', 'Allopurinol 800 mg and Colchicine 500 mg tablets help relieve gout symptoms and manage uric acid levels effectively. Take one tablet daily as directed. Keep out of reach of children. Store below 30°C.\n\n<strong>Features Product:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Zinc oxide, glycerin, and vitamin E.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Benefits:</strong> Protects against UVA/UVB rays, hydrates the skin, and is suitable for sensitive skin.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Texture:</strong> Lightweight and non-greasy, absorbs quickly without leaving a white residue.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Ideal for use on the body during outdoor activities or daily sun protection.</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>How to Use:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Apply generously to the skin before sun exposure.</li>\n 	<li>Reapply every 2 hours or after swimming, sweating, or towel drying.</li>\n 	<li>For best results, use daily as part of your sun protection routine.</li>\n</ul>\nKeep your skin safe and protected with Ultrasun Mineral Body SPF30, your ideal solution for sun protection with mineral-based ingredients.', 'Gout Relief Formula', 'Allopurinol and Colchicine tablets help relieve gout symptoms and support healthy uric acid levels. Take one tablet daily.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'gout-relief-formula', '', '', '2026-10-04 15:59:43', '2026-10-04 15:59:43', '', 0, 'https://wpglozin.com/medicine/shop/ultrasun-mineral-body-spf30/', 0, 'product', '', 1),
(2834, 1, '2025-04-28 02:56:39', '2025-04-28 02:56:39', 'Lansoprazole 15 mg gastro-resistant capsules help reduce stomach acid and relieve heartburn. Keep out of reach of children. Store below 25°C in the original package. Use as directed by the physician and read the leaflet before use.\n\n<strong>Features Product:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Vitamin C, aloe vera, and glycerin.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Benefits:</strong> Removes impurities, promotes skin renewal, and hydrates the skin.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Texture:</strong> Light, airy foam that is gentle and refreshing.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Suitable for all skin types, especially for those looking for a refreshing daily cleanse.</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>How to Use:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Dispense a small amount of the cleanser onto wet hands.</li>\n 	<li>Massage gently onto damp face in circular motions.</li>\n 	<li>Rinse thoroughly with warm water and pat dry with a clean towel.</li>\n 	<li>For best results, use morning and night as part of your daily skincare routine.</li>\n</ul>\nExperience the refreshing, skin-renewing benefits of Renewing Foam Cleanser for a clean, radiant complexion every day.', 'Lansoprazole 15mg', 'Lansoprazole 15 mg capsules help reduce stomach acid and relieve heartburn symptoms. Use as directed by a physician.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lansoprazole-15mg', '', '', '2026-10-04 15:59:43', '2026-10-04 15:59:43', '', 0, 'https://wpglozin.com/medicine/shop/renewing-foam-cleanser-150ml/', 0, 'product', '', 1),
(2837, 1, '2025-04-28 02:56:50', '2025-04-28 02:56:50', 'Colchicine 500 micrograms tablets are used for acute gout flares and prevention of recurrent attacks. Each tablet contains 500 micrograms of colchicine. Take as directed by your doctor. Store below 25°C and keep out of reach of children.\n\n<strong>Features Product:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Natural clay, aloe vera, and green tea extract.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Benefits:</strong> Detoxifies, cleanses, and nourishes the skin, promoting a healthy, radiant glow.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Texture:</strong> Smooth and creamy with a refreshing feel upon application.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Ideal for all skin types, especially for those seeking a deep cleansing and rejuvenating facial experience.</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>How to Use:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Apply an even layer to clean, dry skin.</li>\n 	<li>Leave it on for 10-15 minutes to allow the formula to work its magic.</li>\n 	<li>Rinse off with warm water and gently pat dry.</li>\n 	<li>For best results, use 2-3 times a week as part of your skincare routine.</li>\n</ul>\nExperience a refreshed, detoxified complexion with Skin Detox Arcilla 3 En 1 Facial, the perfect addition to your skincare regimen for clean, glowing skin.', 'Colchicine Tablets', 'Colchicine tablets help relieve acute gout flares and prevent recurrent attacks. Use as directed by your doctor.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'colchicine-tablets', '', '', '2026-10-04 15:59:43', '2026-10-04 15:59:43', '', 0, 'https://wpglozin.com/medicine/shop/skin-detox-arcilla-3-en-1-facial/', 0, 'product', '', 1),
(2840, 1, '2025-04-28 02:57:00', '2025-04-28 02:57:00', 'Indometacin Capsules 25mg help relieve pain and inflammation in conditions such as arthritis and gout. Each capsule contains 25mg of indometacin and should be taken as prescribed. Store below 25°C and keep out of reach of children at all times.\n\n<strong>Features Product:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Retinol, peptides, hyaluronic acid, and vitamin E.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Benefits:</strong> Firms and lifts the skin, reduces fine lines and wrinkles, and improves skin texture.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Texture:</strong> Rich and creamy, easily absorbed into the skin without greasiness.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Ideal for use both day and night to combat signs of aging.</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>How to Use:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Apply a small amount to clean, dry skin.</li>\n 	<li>Massage gently in upward motions, focusing on areas with fine lines or wrinkles.</li>\n 	<li>For best results, use daily as part of your anti-aging skincare routine.</li>\n</ul>\nAchieve firmer, smoother skin and reduce the appearance of wrinkles with Firming and Anti-Wrinkle Cream, your go-to product for a more youthful complexion.', 'Indometacin 25mg', 'Indometacin 25 mg capsules help relieve pain and inflammation from arthritis and gout. Take as prescribed by your doctor.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'indometacin-25mg', '', '', '2026-10-04 15:59:43', '2026-10-04 15:59:43', '', 0, 'https://wpglozin.com/medicine/shop/firming-and-anti-wrinkle-cream/', 0, 'product', '', 1),
(2845, 1, '2025-04-28 02:57:21', '2025-04-28 02:57:21', 'Herbal sleep support with valerian root and passionflower to ease occasional sleeplessness. Designed to promote relaxation and natural rest. Use as directed and follow all label warnings carefully.\n\n<strong>Features Product:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Peptides, hyaluronic acid, and vitamin C.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Benefits:</strong> Helps reduce fine lines, boosts skin elasticity, and provides deep hydration.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Texture:</strong> Rich, creamy, and easily absorbed into the skin.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Ideal for use at night as part of your evening skincare routine.</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>How to Use:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Apply a generous amount to clean, dry skin before bedtime.</li>\n 	<li>Massage gently into the face and neck, allowing it to fully absorb.</li>\n 	<li>For optimal results, use nightly as part of your skincare regimen.</li>\n</ul>\nExperience smoother, firmer skin with Peptide Night Face Moisturizer, your perfect companion for rejuvenating beauty sleep.', 'Deep Sleep & Calm Tablets', 'Herbal sleep support with valerian root and passionflower to promote relaxation and help improve natural sleep quality. Use as directed.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'deep-sleep-calm-tablets', '', '', '2026-10-04 15:59:43', '2026-10-04 15:59:43', '', 0, 'https://wpglozin.com/medicine/shop/peptide-night-face-moisturizer/', 0, 'product', '', 1),
(2851, 1, '2025-04-28 02:57:46', '2025-04-28 02:57:46', 'Sleep support tablets formulated with magnesium and L-tryptophan to help promote restful sleep. Designed for adults 18 and over experiencing occasional sleeplessness. Take one tablet before bedtime and store at room temperature.\n\n<strong>Features Product:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Included Products:</strong> Foundation, eyeshadow, and lip color.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Benefits:</strong> Provides full coverage, vibrant color, and smooth application.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Texture:</strong> Creamy, smooth, and lightweight for comfortable wear throughout the day.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Ideal for creating a complete makeup look with easy, beginner-friendly products.</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>How to Use:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Apply foundation to clean skin for even coverage.</li>\n 	<li>Use eyeshadow to add dimension to your eyes, blending for a seamless finish.</li>\n 	<li>Finish with the lip color for a bold, lasting pout.</li>\n</ul>\nAchieve a flawless, full-face look with this 3-piece makeup set, designed for easy use and beautiful results every time.', 'Dreamtime PM', 'Sleep support tablets with magnesium and L-tryptophan help promote restful sleep for adults experiencing occasional sleeplessness. Take before bedtime.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'dreamtime-pm', '', '', '2026-10-04 15:59:43', '2026-10-04 15:59:43', '', 0, 'https://wpglozin.com/medicine/shop/makeup-kit-3-pieces-makeup-sets/', 0, 'product', '', 1),
(2857, 1, '2025-04-28 02:58:09', '2025-04-28 02:58:09', 'Nighttime sleep aid with L-theanine and melatonin to relieve occasional sleeplessness. Adults 18+ take one tablet 30 minutes before bedtime as directed. Store at room temperature. Not intended for children.\n\n<strong>Features Product:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Shea butter, jojoba oil, and vitamin E.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Benefits:</strong> Long-lasting color with a smooth matte finish and added hydration.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Texture:</strong> Velvety and creamy with a comfortable matte gloss feel.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Ideal for achieving a bold matte look with a hint of gloss.</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>How to Use:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Apply directly to lips for full coverage and a smooth matte finish.</li>\n 	<li>For more precision, use a lip liner before applying lipstick.</li>\n 	<li>Reapply as needed to maintain color and hydration throughout the day.</li>\n</ul>\nGet the best of both matte and glossy finishes with Matte Gloss Matte Lipstick, perfect for a bold yet comfortable look that lasts.', 'Relax & Unwind PM', 'Nighttime sleep aid with L-theanine and melatonin to help relieve occasional sleeplessness. Take one tablet before bedtime.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'relax-unwind-pm', '', '', '2026-10-04 15:59:43', '2026-10-04 15:59:43', '', 0, 'https://wpglozin.com/medicine/shop/matte-gloss-matte-lipstick/', 0, 'product', '', 1),
