(3459, 1, '2026-05-16 13:27:31', '2026-05-16 13:27:31', 'Multi-symptom cold capsules provide relief from pain, fever, congestion, and cough. Formulated with active ingredients to ease common cold discomfort and help you feel better throughout the day. Use as directed.\n\n<strong>Features Product:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Vitamin E, shea butter, and coconut oil.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Benefits:</strong> Provides long-lasting hydration, smooth texture, and a glossy finish.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Texture:</strong> Rich, creamy, and comfortable for all-day wear.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Application:</strong> Ideal for creating a glossy, hydrated pout with vibrant color.</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>How to Use:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Apply directly to lips for an instant glossy finish.</li>\n 	<li>For more definition, outline lips with a lip liner before applying lipstick.</li>\n 	<li>Reapply as needed for continuous hydration and shine.</li>\n</ul>\nAchieve soft, glossy, and beautifully hydrated lips with Glossy Moisturizing Lipstick, perfect for a radiant, everyday look.', 'ColdRelief+', 'Multi-symptom cold capsules help relieve pain, fever, congestion, and cough. Helps ease cold discomfort and support daily comfort.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'coldrelief', '', '', '2026-10-04 15:59:43', '2026-10-04 15:59:43', '', 0, 'https://wpglozin.com/medicine/?post_type=product&amp;p=3459', 0, 'product', '', 1),
(3462, 1, '2026-10-02 13:42:48', '2026-10-02 13:42:48', '<h2>MODENA KS 3290 GTBE: A More Efficient Kitchen Routine</h2>\r\nMODENA KS 3290 GTBE combines two washing areas, granite durability, and 12-in-1 functions in a kitchen sink designed around everyday tasks. From preparing ingredients to washing up after a meal, its workstation concept brings attention to how the sink fits into your kitchen routine.\r\n\r\nThree key benefits define this product: NeoGranite™, an All-in-One Workstation, and Hygienic Bowl Protection. Together, these features highlight its focus on material durability, multifunctional use, and bowl hygiene.\r\n<h3>Two Washing Areas</h3>\r\nA kitchen sink plays a central role before, during, and after cooking. With two washing areas, this model offers a layout for organising different washing tasks within the same workstation.\r\n\r\nWhen planning your kitchen, consider how you normally use the sink, the space available around it, and the relationship between your washing and preparation areas. Reviewing the product layout can help you decide whether it suits your daily habits.\r\n<h3>NeoGranite™ and Granite Durability</h3>\r\nNeoGranite™ is one of the key benefits of the KS 3290 GTBE, alongside the granite durability highlighted in its design. Material choice is an important consideration for a sink used regularly throughout the day.\r\n\r\nFor detailed material specifications and recommended cleaning methods, request the product documentation before choosing your installation and care routine.\r\n<h3>All-in-One Workstation with 12-in-1 Functions</h3>\r\nThe All-in-One Workstation concept brings multiple functions into the sink area. Its 12-in-1 design is intended to support a more efficient kitchen routine, making multifunctionality a central part of the product.\r\n\r\nBefore purchasing, ask for the complete function list and confirmation of the accessories included with this model. This will help you understand how the workstation can support the tasks you perform most often.\r\n<h3>Hygienic Bowl Protection</h3>\r\nHygienic Bowl Protection is another highlighted product benefit. For information about how this feature works and how to maintain the bowl correctly, consult the official product guidance. Follow the recommended care instructions as part of your regular kitchen cleaning routine.\r\n<h3>Ask About MODENA KS 3290 GTBE</h3>\r\nInterested in making this workstation part of your kitchen? Click <strong>Chat via WhatsApp</strong> or complete the inquiry form to request further information. You can ask about dimensions, installation requirements, included accessories, current pricing, and availability before making your decision.', 'KS 3290 GTBE', 'Designed with two washing areas, granite durability, and 12-in-1 functions for a more efficient kitchen routine.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'modena-ks-3290-gtbe', '', '', '2026-10-05 05:53:47', '2026-10-05 05:53:47', '', 0, 'https://wpglozin.com/medicine/?post_type=product&#038;p=3462', 0, 'product', '', 1),
