themeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/Blog-main-1-600x427.webp 600w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/Blog-main-1-130x92.webp 130w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/Blog-main-1.webp 1800w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></a>		\n		<a href=\"#\">Medicine</a>		<h3><a href=\"#\" rel=\"bookmark\">Ways To Prevent Stroke</a></h3>		<p>The risk of stroke increases with age, especially in men or those with a family history of stroke.</p>		\n			Post by <a href=\"#\">Youngly</a>			 May 16, 2026		\n</article>\n<article id=\"post-3288\">\n			<a href=\"#\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"728\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/Blog-main-2-1024x728.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/Blog-main-2-1024x728.webp 1024w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/Blog-main-2-300x213.webp 300w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/Blog-main-2-768x546.webp 768w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/Blog-main-2-1536x1092.webp 1536w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/Blog-main-2-600x427.webp 600w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/Blog-main-2-130x92.webp 130w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/Blog-main-2.webp 1800w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></a>		\n		<a href=\"#\">Medicine</a>		<h3><a href=\"#\" rel=\"bookmark\">High Cholesterol: Causes, Treatment</a></h3>		<p>Unhealthy diet: Consuming large amounts of saturated and trans fats, found in animal fat, fried foods.</p>		\n			Post by <a href=\"#\">Youngly</a>			 May 16, 2026		\n</article>\n<article id=\"post-3286\">\n			<a href=\"#\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"728\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/Blog-main-3-1024x728.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/Blog-main-3-1024x728.webp 1024w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/Blog-main-3-300x213.webp 300w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/Blog-main-3-768x546.webp 768w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/Blog-main-3-1536x1092.webp 1536w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/Blog-main-3-600x427.webp 600w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/Blog-main-3-130x92.webp 130w, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uixthemeswp/glozin/refs/heads/main/importer/demo-content/images/Blog-main-3.webp 1800w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></a>		\n		<a href=\"#\">Medicine</a>		<h3><a href=\"#\" rel=\"bookmark\">Physical Activity And Improved Health</a></h3>		<p>Improve physical health: Strengthen muscles and endurance, improve cardiovascular function.</p>		\n			Post by <a href=\"#\">Youngly</a>			 May 16, 2026		\n</article><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" width=\"7\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 11\" fill=\"currentColor\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M5.5 11L0 5.5L5.5 0L6.47625 0.97625L1.9525 5.5L6.47625 10.0238L5.5 11Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" width=\"7\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 11\" fill=\"currentColor\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M1.5 11L7 5.5L1.5 0L0.52375 0.97625L5.0475 5.5L0.52375 10.0238L1.5 11Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>', 'Home - Medicine', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '364-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-18 09:16:38', '2025-03-18 09:16:38', '', 364, 'http://munas-macbook-air.local/modena/?p=1000002', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
